    ├─ Message: User-provided message
    ├─ Exception: Stack trace (if applicable)
    ↓
3. Determine log file
    ├─ Directory: Application Root + /logs/
    ├─ Filename: logs/{Level}.log or general.log
    ↓
4. Append to file
    ├─ Thread-safe write
    ├─ UTF-8 encoding
    ↓
5. Return to caller
```

**Log Levels:**
- `Info` - General information
- `Warning` - Warning conditions
- `Error` - Error conditions

**Log File Locations:**
- `logs\info.log` - Information messages
- `logs\error.log` - Error messages
- `logs\general.log` - All messages
- `logs\spinerror.log` - Spin service errors

